      "edu.body.p2":
        "Confidence is contingent on different things for different people, and what it rests on decides what actually builds it:\n• Body: feeling at home in your body and its responses; grows by slowing down into sensation.\n• Skill: feeling competent, that you are good at this; grows through feedback.\n• Reception: feeling wanted; grows through a partner's visible desire.\n• Safety: staying present without losing yourself; grows through trust.\n• Meaning: the moment mattering to you; grows through presence.\nMost people are strong in one and shaky in another. The label at the top of this section names the one yours leans on most.",
