      "edu.eyebrow": "Learn: sexual confidence",
      "edu.teaser":
        "Sexual confidence isn't one thing. It rests on the body, on skill, on being wanted, on safety, or on meaning. What yours is contingent on decides what actually builds it, which is why generic advice so often lands nowhere.",
