      "edu.eyebrow": "Learn: pattern and level",
      "edu.teaser":
        "Desire curves differ: some spike in seconds, others build like a slow wave. Wave-with-spike is the most common couple pairing, and the timing between them, not low desire, causes most of the friction.",
      "edu.body.p1":
        "Energy level is the pace and activation you bring to sex, and it's worth separating from two things it gets confused with. It isn't libido or motivation: two people can want sex equally and still run at very different speeds. And pattern is not the same as level. Pattern is how desire moves (a slow wave, a fast spike, a steady hum), while level is how much there is. You can be high-desire and slow-building, or lower-desire and quick to ignite.",
