      "loosen.8.belief": "I need reassurance that I'm doing it right",
      "loosen.8.shift": "I can trust my own sense of what feels good",
      "loosen.9.belief": "Slowing down to learn makes me less exciting",
      "loosen.9.shift": "Exploring together is its own turn-on",
      "loosen.10.belief": "Letting fear lead keeps me safe",
      "loosen.10.shift": "My desire is safe to follow, even imperfectly",
      "edu.body.p3":
        "Beliefs don't rewrite through willpower or insight alone. They update through lived counter-evidence: small, safe experiences that contradict the old rule, which is exactly what each shift on the right is designed to create.",
      "learn.eyebrow": "What you will learn",
      "learn.body":
        "In this chapter you will learn where your beliefs about sex came from, mostly installed before you had a say. Which ones still serve you, and which quietly box you in.",
