      "edu.body.p6":
        "Contextual: attachment expression shifts with partner, power dynamics, and safety.",
      "body.p1":
        "Home is the solid dot: close and in command at once, able to lead and trust when respect is clear, with the glow around it showing how much of the map feels steady. The hollow dot is where disrespect or a messy, unclear moment sends you. You don't stop being secure. You just start gripping the frame tighter, reading softness as risk, going cool and composed to keep the ground from shifting. Watch which way you drift. It moves toward control, not toward the door. Restored respect and clear agreements, felt again and again, walk the dot back home.",
