      "edu.eyebrow": "Learn: arousal, desire, and pleasure",
      "edu.teaser":
        "Desire is the wanting; arousal is the body's activation. They don't always agree, and in some styles the usual order even reverses. Which order yours runs decides when an evening should actually start.",
